---
/**
 * 全站客服微信弹窗（横向）
 * 左：购买流程（提前告知）· 右：二维码
 */
---

<div class="qr-modal" id="qrModal" aria-hidden="true">
  <div
    class="modal-card modal-card--split"
    role="dialog"
    aria-modal="true"
    aria-labelledby="modalTitle"
    aria-describedby="modalDesc"
  >
    <button class="modal-close" type="button" onclick="closeQrModal()" aria-label="关闭">
      <span aria-hidden="true">×</span>
    </button>

    <div class="qr-modal-body">
      <!-- 左：购买流程 -->
      <div class="qr-modal-panel qr-modal-panel--flow">
        <div class="qr-modal-badge">购买须知</div>
        <h2 class="qr-modal-title" id="modalTitle">怎么购买</h2>
        <p class="qr-modal-lead" id="modalDesc">
          本站展示价格与套餐，<strong>下单在微信完成</strong>。先确认再付款，避免付错套餐。
        </p>

        <ol class="qr-steps">
          <li class="qr-step">
            <span class="qr-step-num" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
            <div class="qr-step-body">
              <strong>添加客服微信</strong>
              <p>用手机微信扫右侧二维码，备注想开的套餐。</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="qr-step">
            <span class="qr-step-num" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
            <div class="qr-step-body">
              <strong>说明你的需求</strong>
              <p>告诉客服：套餐名称、账号是否已有会员。我们先确认能否开通。</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="qr-step">
            <span class="qr-step-num" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
            <div class="qr-step-body">
              <strong>确认后微信支付</strong>
              <p>价格与网站一致。确认无误后再付款，开通到你本人账号。</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ol>

        <ul class="qr-trust-row" aria-label="服务保障">
          <li>1 对 1 跟进</li>
          <li>无需密码</li>
          <li>本人账号开通</li>
          <li>失败按规则退</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- 右：二维码 -->
      <div class="qr-modal-panel qr-modal-panel--qr">
        <p class="qr-panel-kicker">扫码添加客服</p>
        <div class="qr-frame" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="qr-scan-line"></span>
          <img
            class="qr-image"
            src="/images/qrcode.png"
            alt="客服微信二维码"
            width="200"
            height="200"
          />
        </div>
        <p class="qr-hint">微信扫一扫 · 备注套餐更快处理</p>
        <p class="qr-reassure">仅用于订单沟通，不推销无关内容</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
